sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户/UI(SSE)
    participant S as session.Service
    participant A as admission(队列/执行槽)
    participant E as engine.Supervisor
    participant C as engine.conn(JSON-RPC)
    participant W as worker(loop.py)
    participant B as event.Bus
    participant M as metrics.Hub
    participant P as server.pump(SSE)

    Note over U,M: 方向一：可测量性补齐（先于任何优化）
    Note over S,M: ① 排队延迟 run_queue_wait_seconds
    U->>S: Send(用户消息)
    S->>A: admit(ar, start) 记录 enqueuedAt
    A-->>S: 拿到执行槽 / 排队
    S->>E: StartRun(rr, sink=handleEvent)

    Note over W,M: ② 事件首字节 run_event_first_byte_seconds
    W->>C: run.event(text.delta) 经单连接
    C->>E: dispatchEvent → deliver(rs, ev)
    E->>M: ObserveFirstByte(worker emit → sink 投递)
    E->>S: deliver → sink = handleEvent(ar, ev)
    S->>M: ObserveEventPublish(handleEvent 持 ar.mu 全程)

    Note over S,B: ③ 总线发布 Bus.Publish（全局 b.mu）
    S->>B: publishRun(ev)
    B->>B: 持 b.mu 扇出到各订阅 sub.C
    B->>M: ObserveBusPublish(扇出耗时)
    B-->>P: ev 入 sub.C(慢订阅不阻塞发布者)

    Note over P,U: ④ SSE 批次 sse_pump_batch
    P->>P: pump 批量 sseBatch 条后 flush
    P-->>U: 文本增量上屏

    Note over U,M: 方向二/三：收到指标后的低风险优化验证
    Note over A,M: 方向三：调度 —— 用 run_queue_wait P95 验证优先级/久候提升有效
    Note over W,M: 方向二：worker 单连接吞吐 —— 用 worker_rpc_events_total / 首字节 P99 验证
